## Acceptance Criteria

### Real-Time Fraud Scoring
- [ ] Score every payment transaction before processing
- [ ] Score subscription creations and changes
- [ ] Complete scoring in < 200ms (non-blocking)
- [ ] Support asynchronous scoring for background checks
- [ ] Score = 0-100 (0 safe, 100 definite fraud)
- [ ] Calculate risk level (Low/Medium/High/Critical)
- [ ] Generate decision (Allow/Review/Block)
- [ ] Store all signals contributing to score
- [ ] Log decision reasoning for audit

### Fraud Detection Rules
- [ ] **Velocity Check:** Detect multiple transactions in short time (>3 in 10 min)
- [ ] **IP Blacklist:** Block known malicious IP ranges
- [ ] **Email Blacklist:** Flag disposable email providers (mailinator, guerrillamail, etc.)
- [ ] **BIN Check:** Compare card country to user country
- [ ] **Device Fingerprint:** Detect same device across multiple accounts
- [ ] **High-Risk Country:** Flag transactions from countries with high fraud rates
- [ ] **Card Testing Pattern:** Detect small rapid transactions (bot testing)
- [ ] **Behavior Anomaly:** Flag unusual purchase amounts or patterns
- [ ] **AVS Mismatch:** Address verification system failures
- [ ] **CVV Failure:** Card security code check failures
- [ ] **Proxy/VPN Detection:** Flag users behind anonymization services
- [ ] **Account Age:** New account + high-value purchase flagged
- [ ] **Time Zone Mismatch:** User timezone vs IP location discrepancy

### Fraud Actions
- [ ] **Allow:** Low-risk transactions processed normally
- [ ] **Review:** Medium/high-risk flagged for manual review
