# Multi-Gateway Payment Processing

## Request Type
Feature Request

## User Story
As a **SaaS platform**, I want to **support multiple payment gateways with automatic failover** so that I can **maximize payment success rates, reduce vendor lock-in, and optimize transaction costs**.

## Problem Statement
Relying on a single payment gateway creates risks:
- Gateway outages cause revenue loss
- Regional gateway performance varies (EU vs US)
- Transaction fees differ by gateway and card type
- Vendor lock-in limits negotiation power
- Different gateways excel at different payment methods

A multi-gateway architecture provides:
- Automatic failover on gateway downtime
- Smart routing based on cost/performance
- Geographic optimization
- Payment method specialization (cards vs ACH vs wallets)
- A/B testing of gateways

## Proposed Solution
Implement a multi-gateway payment processing system with intelligent routing:

### Gateway Abstraction
