## Technical Requirements

### Database Schema
- Refunds table with (PaymentId, CreatedAt) index
- PaymentDisputes table with (Status, RespondByDate) index
- DisputeEvidence table with (DisputeId) index
- Foreign keys to Payments, Invoices, Subscriptions

### Background Jobs
- Process approved refunds (every 5 minutes)
- Retry failed refunds (hourly)
- Sync dispute status from gateways (every 15 minutes)
- Send dispute deadline reminders (daily)
- Collect automated evidence (on dispute creation)

### Integration Points
- **Payment Gateway**: Process refunds, sync disputes
- **Wallet Module**: Credit wallet on refunds
- **Invoices Module**: Update invoice status
- **Subscriptions Module**: Handle subscription cancellation refunds
- **Notifications Module**: Email notifications

### Standards
- ISO 4217 for currency codes
- RFC 7807 for error responses
- Idempotency for refund operations
- Audit log for all refund/dispute operations

## Dependencies
- Payment gateway integrations (Stripe, PayPal)
- File storage service (for evidence files)
- Notification service (email)
- Background job scheduler (Hangfire)

